<title>USA: Noram Energy Corp Q1 EPS $0.50 vs $0.47.</title>
<headline>Noram Energy Corp Q1 EPS $0.50 vs $0.47.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary     $0.50		    $0.47</p>
<p> Shr diluted     0.46		     0.47</p>
<p> Net		 68,600		   60,900</p>
<p> Oper revs	 145,200		  168,900</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary137,956		  124,991</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted152,183		  124,991</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Quarters ended March 31.</p>
<p>Results for the 1996 quarter includes a charge of $22.3 million for early retirement, severance and reorganization of certain units. It also reflects payment of a $2 million preferred dividend requirement. Those prefered shares were exchanged for convertible debt in June, 1996.</p>
